// code_intel_hub — hub questions: which symbols under a prefix does the
// rest of the repo call most. Gold = the top-5 qualified names by non-test call sites over
// live `calls` edges of code-clickhouse (staging census 2026-09-14, symbols outside the repo
// and test-defined symbols excluded, overloads collapsed to one name). The lane measures the
// read path (prefix filter, exclusions, order) against the materialised truth, so a miss is
// plumbing, not ranking; regenerate the gold from the same aggregation when the index moves.
// Asked as code.search {query, path_prefix, sort_by: fan_in, top_k: 10, bodies: none};
// hub recall@5 = |gold ∩ top-5 result symbols| / 5.
